{"ClientPermissionsV2.getClientsWithPermission() iterates resources by type Clients and returns resource.getName(), which can include the schema-wide Clients resource and miss per-client resources because getOrCreateResource() never sets a Resource type, causing NullPointerException in AvailableRoleMappingResource when it dereferences realm.getClientById(cid) without null checks and producing wrong role-mapping results": 0.30388227105140686, "AdminPermissionsSchema.init() exits when the admin-permissions client already exists, so realms enabled before this PR will not get the newly-added Clients scopes/resources persisted in the admin-permissions ResourceServer, causing getOrCreateResource() to throw missing scopes and ClientPermissionsV2 to NPE when assuming the Clients all-resource exists for fallback evaluation": 0.7897169589996338}